{
  "kanji": "対",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 対\ntitle: oppose; face\njlpt: 3\ntags: [jlpt-n3, grade-3, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 7\nradical: 寸\nradicalNumber: 41\nonyomi: [タイ, ツイ]\nkunyomi: [あいて, こた.える, そろ.い, つれあ.い, なら.ぶ, むか.う]\ndistractors: [文, 持, 時]\n---\n\n# 対 — oppose; face\n\n**Strokes:** 7 · **Key (radical):** 寸 (no. 41) · **JLPT:** N3 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n対 puts one side in relation to another: opposing it, facing it, or forming a pair.\n[反対](../words/反対.md) はんたい expresses opposition, whereas 対話 たいわ is dialogue.\nThus the character does not make every word hostile: two sides may be talking rather than fighting.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic:** see 文 on the left facing 寸 on the right.\nThe image of two facing sides is a memory aid, not a claim about how the character developed.\n\n## Readings\n\nThe on readings below are useful starting points; the full source reading inventory is in the metadata.\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| タイ | on | [反対](../words/反対.md) はんたい — opposition; 対話 たいわ — dialogue |\n| ツイ | on | 一対 いっつい — a pair |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [反対](../words/反対.md) はんたい — opposition; the opposite\n- 対話 たいわ — dialogue; conversation\n- 一対 いっつい — a pair\n\n## Notes\n\n一対 has a small っ: いっつい, not いちつい.\nFor recognition, [文](文.md) lacks the right-hand 寸 altogether.\n[持](持.md) and [時](時.md) also contain 寸 within 寺, but their left sides and overall structures differ.\n\nSources: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project);\n[JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1480670, 1410300, 1164550.\n",
